{"currentMessages":[{"content":"开始本次 Recommendation 执行。","role":"user","timestamp":1788854400000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 家常烹饪 (home cooking), focusing on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. Explicitly NOT interested in restaurant operations or kitchen appliance promotions.\n- Working set: 80 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The interest explicitly excludes content about 餐饮门店经营 (restaurant operations) or 厨电促销 (kitchen appliance promotions). Many candidates have \"市场观察\" (market observation) content type which describes restaurant chain store location, franchise contracts, delivery promotions, and kitchen appliance package discounts - these directly conflict with the user's stated disinterest.\n\nLet me identify the content types:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - reproducible methods\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - cooking principles\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - describes local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution and folk stories\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - restaurant operations and appliance promotions\n\nThe user's interest: 家常烹饪，关注可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理，不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销。\n\nSo I should EXCLUDE 市场观察 candidates (they're about restaurant operations and appliance promotions).\n\nThe 专题观察 candidates describe local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories - these are somewhat tangential to the cooking interest but not explicitly excluded. However, they don't match the core interest of reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles as well.\n\nThe best matches for the interest are:\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - reproducible methods ✓\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - cooking principles ✓\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - provides problem directory for further reading\n\nLet me count the candidates by type. I need to select 20 from the 80 exposed.\n\nLet me look at the working set. The candidates list has 80 items. Let me identify which are 市场观察 (to exclude) and which are good matches.\n\nLet me categorize. The interest is about home cooking with reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. The user explicitly does not care about restaurant operations or kitchen appliance promotions.\n\nMarket observation (市场观察) candidates should be excluded as they directly conflict with the explicit disinterest.\n\nLet me identify the good candidates. I'll select from 操作记录, 条件与原理, and 概念速览 types, which align with the interest.\n\nLet me count available candidates of each relevant type in the working set. Given the large number, let me plan.\n\nLet me set up a plan and identify candidates.\n\nActually, let me first identify all the candidates and their types. Given the volume, let me categorize by title suffix.\n\nLet me list candidates that are NOT 市场观察 and NOT 专题观察 (since 专题观察 is about food history/culture, less aligned with cooking principles/methods but not excluded).\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The interest says: 家常烹饪，关注可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理. So the core is reproducible methods, ingredient handling, cooking principles.\n\n- 操作记录: reproducible methods ✓ (strongest)\n- 条件与原理: cooking principles ✓ (strongest)\n- 概念速览: concept overview, provides problem directory ✓ (relevant)\n- 专题观察: local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories - this is cultural content, less aligned but not excluded\n- 市场观察: restaurant operations, appliance promotions - EXCLUDED by explicit disinterest\n\nI should select 20 candidates. Let me prioritize 操作记录 and 条件与原理, then 概念速览, and possibly some 专题观察 for balance. But given the explicit disinterest in restaurant/appliance content, I'll exclude all 市场观察.\n\nLet me count the candidates of each type in the working set to ensure I have enough.\n\nLet me go through the list and categorize. Given the large number, let me identify the relevant candidates.\n\nLet me count the candidates. I'll categorize each by its title.\n\nGiven the huge list, let me just select 20 strong candidates that align with the interest. Let me pick a balanced set across dishes and content types (excluding 市场观察).\n\nLet me identify the dishes/topics present:\n- 煎豆腐 (pan-fried tofu)\n- 煎饺 (pan-fried dumplings)\n- 米饭含水量 (rice water content)\n- 清汤调味 (clear soup seasoning)\n- 蒸鱼 (steamed fish)\n- 番茄炒蛋 (tomato scrambled eggs)\n- 鸡胸肉口感 (chicken breast texture)\n- 面团发酵 (dough fermentation)\n- 炖牛肉 (braised beef)\n- 蔬菜焯水 (vegetable blanching)\n\nContent types: 概念速览, 操作记录, 条件与原理, 专题观察, 市场观察.\n\nI want to select 20 candidates, excluding 市场观察. Let me pick a balanced set across dishes and content types.\n\nLet me select candidates that are 操作记录, 条件与原理, and 概念速览 types, which best match the interest. I'll aim for diversity across dishes.\n\nLet me identify specific candidates. I'll go through the list and pick.\n\nGiven the volume, let me select 20 candidates. Let me choose a good spread.\n\nLet me pick candidates of the strongest types (操作记录, 条件与原理) and some 概念速览, avoiding 市场观察 and minimizing 专题观察.\n\nLet me list the candidates I'll select. I'll pick across different dishes for balance.\n\nLet me select these 20 (excluding market observation):\n\n1. item-020de9869dd2 - 煎豆腐 两人晚餐 概念速览\n2. item-024e99402549 - 煎饺 工作日备餐 操作记录\n3. item-02ec789dd9bf - 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n4. item-0714769b6401 - 煎豆腐 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n5. item-085ac75e2f6f - 煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n6. item-0ac37da79bac - 蒸鱼 工作日备餐 条件与原理\n7. item-0d56e35e7f71 - 番茄炒蛋 小份试做 概念速览\n8. item-0ef03b868945 - 鸡胸肉口感 小份试做 条件与原理\n9. item-1d12fb72a0b5 - 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n10. item-1f7a4e5259fb - 蔬菜焯水 小份试做 条件与原理\n11. item-20168695fc11 - 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理\n12. item-2062e507d111 - 蒸鱼 两人晚餐 操作记录\n13. item-20d117d62c34 - 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n14. item-2395d5837e77 - 米饭含水量 工作日备餐 概念速览\n15. item-2802591dd8c9 - 蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐 操作记录\n16. item-2bd3f1c7d71a - 面团发酵 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理\n17. item-3302498cd23d - 煎饺 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n18. item-342993e68175 - 炖牛肉 工作日备餐 操作记录\n19. item-34eb4892cc8d - 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理\n20. item-3632e4c9f026 - 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 概念速览\n\nWait, let me reconsider balance. I want to avoid too much repetition of the same dish. Let me check the spread.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The task says prefer a balanced collection across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types. All candidates are from the same source (open_web) and same interest. So balance should be across content types and dishes.\n\nLet me reconsider whether to include 专题观察. The 专题观察 content is about local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories. This is somewhat tangential to the cooking interest (which focuses on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, cooking principles). It's not explicitly excluded, but it's less aligned. I'll include a few for content-type balance but prioritize the core types.\n\nActually, given the interest is quite specific about reproducible methods and cooking principles, and the user explicitly doesn't care about restaurant/appliance content, I think the best collection focuses on 操作记录, 条件与原理, and 概念速览. These three types directly serve the interest.\n\nLet me reconsider the count of each type available. Let me verify I have enough non-market candidates.\n\nLet me count candidates by type from the list. Given the large number, let me just verify my selection of 20 is all valid and non-market.\n\nLet me reconsider my selection to ensure good dish diversity and content type balance. Let me aim for roughly:\n- ~8 操作记录\n- ~7 条件与原理\n- ~5 概念速览\n\nAnd across dishes, cover all 10 topics.\n\nLet me refine my selection. Let me pick candidates ensuring dish diversity.\n\nLet me reconsider. I'll select 20 candidates. Let me verify each candidate ID exists in the list and is not a market observation.\n\nLet me finalize a balanced set. I'll pick across the 10 dishes and 3 content types (excluding market observation and 专题观察).\n\nLet me select:\n\n操作记录 (reproducible methods):\n- item-024e99402549 煎饺 工作日备餐\n- item-02ec789dd9bf 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐\n- item-085ac75e2f6f 煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐\n- item-1d12fb72a0b5 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐\n- item-2062e507d111 蒸鱼 两人晚餐\n- item-2802591dd8c9 蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐\n- item-342993e68175 炖牛肉 工作日备餐\n- item-41f1925e3d74 米饭含水量 工作日备餐\n\n条件与原理 (cooking principles):\n- item-0714769b6401 煎豆腐 两人晚餐\n- item-0ac37da79bac 蒸鱼 工作日备餐\n- item-0ef03b868945 鸡胸肉口感 小份试做\n- item-1f7a4e5259fb 蔬菜焯水 小份试做\n- item-20168695fc11 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐\n- item-20d117d62c34 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐\n- item-2bd3f1c7d71a 面团发酵 家庭周末午餐\n- item-3302498cd23d 煎饺 两人晚餐\n\n概念速览 (concept overview):\n- item-020de9869dd2 煎豆腐 两人晚餐\n- item-0d56e35e7f71 番茄炒蛋 小份试做\n- item-2395d5837e77 米饭含水量 工作日备餐\n- item-3632e4c9f026 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐\n\nThat's 8+8+4 = 20. \n\nLet me verify dish coverage: 煎饺, 清汤调味, 煎豆腐, 蒸鱼, 蔬菜焯水, 炖牛肉, 米饭含水量, 鸡胸肉口感, 番茄炒蛋, 面团发酵. All 10 dishes covered. Good.\n\nContent type balance: 8 操作记录, 8 条件与原理, 4 概念速览. Reasonable.\n\nAll these are non-market, non-专题观察. Good.\n\nLet me verify each candidate ID is present in the list. Let me double check each.\n\nFrom the list:\n- item-020de9869dd2 ✓ 煎豆腐 两人晚餐 概念速览\n- item-024e99402549 ✓ 煎饺 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-02ec789dd9bf ✓ 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-0714769b6401 ✓ 煎豆腐 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n- item-085ac75e2f6f ✓ 煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-0ac37da79bac ✓ 蒸鱼 工作日备餐 条件与原理\n- item-0d56e35e7f71 ✓ 番茄炒蛋 小份试做 概念速览\n- item-0ef03b868945 ✓ 鸡胸肉口感 小份试做 条件与原理\n- item-1d12fb72a0b5 ✓ 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-1f7a4e5259fb ✓ 蔬菜焯水 小份试做 条件与原理\n- item-20168695fc11 ✓ 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理\n- item-2062e507d111 ✓ 蒸鱼 两人晚餐 操作记录\n- item-20d117d62c34 ✓ 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n- item-2395d5837e77 ✓ 米饭含水量 工作日备餐 概念速览\n- item-2802591dd8c9 ✓ 蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-2bd3f1c7d71a ✓ 面团发酵 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理\n- item-3302498cd23d ✓ 煎饺 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n- item-342993e68175 ✓ 炖牛肉 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-3632e4c9f026 ✓ 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 概念速览\n- item-41f1925e3d74 ✓ 米饭含水量 工作日备餐 操作记录\n\nAll 20 present and valid.\n\nNow let me write recommendation reasons grounded in facts for each. Each reason should explain why the co